  "plain": "Aldo Rebelo, a former Brazilian Defense Minister speaking on Jesse Michels's podcast, says that in 1996 an army unit based in Três Corações, a town near Varginha in Brazil, sent at least part of its troops to support an operation there. Varginha is the town where, many people say, a craft came down and a strange creature was captured that year. Coming from a former defense minister, it suggests the army really was involved."
